            "text": "А гды Іс҃ Хс҃ ѡ невѣрных Жидовъ былъ пойманый и на",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              150,
              973,
              957,
              35
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-v3-s00168-20261126",
                "language": "orv",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true,
                "start": 0,
                "end": 50
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "body-3-line-02",
            "text": "смр҃ть даный, въ той же часъ всѣ ап҃ли Ха҃ ѡхабили и повтѣ-",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              150,
              1008,
              957,
              35
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-v3-s00168-20261126",
                "language": "orv",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true,
                "start": 0,
                "end": 59
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "body-3-line-03",
            "text": "хали [sic!] про великїй страхъ. А ст҃ый Іѡанъ не оутѣкалъ ѡ",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              150,
              1043,
              957,
              35
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-v3-s00168-20261126",
                "language": "orv",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true,
                "start": 0,
                "end": 6
              },
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-v3-s00168-20261126",
                "language": "la",
                "script": "Latn",
                "uncertain": false,
                "start": 6,
                "end": 10
              },
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-v3-s00168-20261126",
                "language": "orv",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true,
                "start": 10,
                "end": 59
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "body-3-line-04",
            "text": "Хр҃та, але при Хр҃тѣ былъ и смотрѣлъ на мѹки Хр҃твы. и гды",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              150,
              1078,
              957,
              35
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-v3-s00168-20261126",
                "language": "orv",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true,
                "start": 0,
                "end": 58
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "body-3-line-05",
            "text": "Іс҃ Хс҃ былъ распятый на кр҃тѣ и пребл҃гословенная Мр҃їа мт҃и",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              150,
              1113,
              957,
              35
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-v3-s00168-20261126",
                "language": "orv",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true,
                "start": 0,
                "end": 61
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "body-3-line-06",
            "text": "Хр҃това видѣла Іс҃ Ха҃ сн҃а своего оукыр'вавленаго на кр҃тѣ распа-",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              150,
              1148,
              957,
              35
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-v3-s00168-20261126",
                "language": "orv",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true,
                "start": 0,
                "end": 66
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "body-3-line-07",
            "text": "таго и ребро прободеннаго, во той же час Мр҃їа прч҃тая оумлѣла",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              150,
              1183,
              957,
              35
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-v3-s00168-20261126",
                "language": "orv",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true,
                "start": 0,
                "end": 62
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "body-3-line-08",
            "text": "и слезами землю поливала, такїй великїй болъ мала во ср҃дци",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              150,
              1218,
              957,
              36
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-v3-s00168-20261126",
                "language": "orv",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true,
                "start": 0,
                "end": 59
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "body-3-line-09",
            "text": "своем: яко ѡрѹжїе ср҃дце еи Бж҃ественное болъ прошедъ, якоже",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              150,
              1254,
              957,
              35
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-v3-s00168-20261126",
                "language": "orv",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true,
                "start": 0,
                "end": 60
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "body-3-line-10",
            "text": "свѣтчит въ ег҃лїи ст҃ом: „самое же тебѣ дш҃ѹ ѡрѹжїе проидет“.",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              150,
              1289,
              957,
              35
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-v3-s00168-20261126",
                "language": "orv",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true,
                "start": 0,
                "end": 26
              },
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-v3-s00168-20261126",
                "language": "cu",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true,
                "start": 26,
                "end": 59
              },
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-v3-s00168-20261126",
                "language": "orv",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true,
                "start": 59,
                "end": 61
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "body-3-line-11",
            "text": "Во той же час пребл҃гословенная Мр҃їа на правой сторонѣ кр҃та",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              150,
              1324,
              957,
              35
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-v3-s00168-20261126",
                "language": "orv",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true,
                "start": 0,
                "end": 61
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "body-3-line-12",
            "text": "стояла, а ст҃ый Іѡанъ на лѣвой сторонѣ кр҃та стоялъ. и гды",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              150,
              1359,
              957,
              35
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-v3-s00168-20261126",
                "language": "orv",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true,
                "start": 0,
                "end": 58
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "body-3-line-13",
            "text": "преч҃тая со слезами плачѹщи до сн҃а своего волала глаголюще:",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              150,
              1394,
              957,
              35
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-v3-s00168-20261126",
                "language": "orv",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true,
                "start": 0,
                "end": 60
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "body-3-line-14",
            "text": "„Ѡ сн҃ѹ мой любимый, комѹ мя ѡставишъ?“ А Хс҃ъ на кр҃тѣ",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              150,
              1429,
              957,
              35
            ],
            "geometry_estimated": true,
            "language_spans": [
              {
                "text_version": "gpt62-v3-s00168-20261126",
                "language": "orv",
                "script": "Cyrl",
                "uncertain": true,
                "start": 0,
                "end": 55
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "body-3-line-15",
            "text": "прореклъ до мт҃ки свой: „Мт҃ко моя, тебѣ Іѡана за сн҃а порѹ-",
            "bbox_xywh": [
              150,
              1464,
              957,
              36
